{"about_the_game":"<strong>Get lost beneath the fog in The Wild Eternal, a reflective first-person exploration game.</strong><br><br>It is the early 1600\u2019s.<br><br>You are an old woman named Ananta who has fled a life of suffering to search for lasting peace in the Himalayan wild. After a traumatic life, you long to escape the cycle of reincarnation so that you may finally rest in peace.<br><br>Your defiance of reincarnation has landed you in a lush, deserted wilderness covered in fog. A fox-shaped demigod agrees to help you escape your fate, but only if you\u2019ll help him in return. <br><br>Explore the mystical wilderness together as you embark on a meditative adventure to heal the scars of your past in hopes of avoiding an eternity of suffering.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a Mystical and Mysterious World: Explore a vastly beautiful wilderness blanketed in fog as you journey from clear vistas to distant landmarks.<br></li><li>Find Your Own Way: While lost in the fog, you'll find ancient artifacts and unlock powerful abilities at hidden shrines.<br></li><li>Interact with Strange Wildlife: Encounter wild, and sometimes dangerous creatures, each with distinct personalities. With no means to attack them, tread mindfully on your journey.<br></li><li>Uncover a Tangled Narrative: Play as an old woman, Ananta, seeking to escape the cycle of reincarnation and search to uncover the truth about her past.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself: Get lost beneath the fog in this 6-9 hour game designed to be a meditative hike riddled with powerful narrative and mystery.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"87bc271718f7e146dd35a31940c53cbda3e3170b.jpg","localized_name":"Curiouser and Curiouser","name":"Curiouser and Curiouser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/87bc271718f7e146dd35a31940c53cbda3e3170b.jpg"},{"icon":"e94a510fb3150de13a3b21ce123789ce245d3d39.jpg","localized_name":"Which Way?","name":"Which Way?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/e94a510fb3150de13a3b21ce123789ce245d3d39.jpg"},{"icon":"6852328aa9cd0d32a3f7af4618deb01a9efc3dbf.jpg","localized_name":"Haunted","name":"Haunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/6852328aa9cd0d32a3f7af4618deb01a9efc3dbf.jpg"},{"icon":"cdbf8f9803662a65613151630cc6c0c9588458bc.jpg","localized_name":"Hoarder","name":"Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/cdbf8f9803662a65613151630cc6c0c9588458bc.jpg"},{"icon":"ddbfe5b2576645213ffb098088f176df840f26b2.jpg","localized_name":"We Don't Need Roads","name":"We Don't Need Roads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/ddbfe5b2576645213ffb098088f176df840f26b2.jpg"},{"icon":"b35ebafbea2b4d09161bb1d8ce1e281a8e6f377c.jpg","localized_name":"Heights Schmeights","name":"Heights Schmeights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/b35ebafbea2b4d09161bb1d8ce1e281a8e6f377c.jpg"},{"icon":"16a6e4ece74a43a52947de932ecdf0929e6b3613.jpg","localized_name":"Actually, It's A Running Simulator","name":"Actually, It's A Running Simulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/16a6e4ece74a43a52947de932ecdf0929e6b3613.jpg"},{"icon":"0ca7824c5125177e974477373ff32a8f867ae16a.jpg","localized_name":"Wanderer","name":"Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/0ca7824c5125177e974477373ff32a8f867ae16a.jpg"},{"icon":"c522de6c9fea1c04b37091ba2fca32422d35d98c.jpg","localized_name":"A New Record!","name":"A New Record!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/554810/c522de6c9fea1c04b37091ba2fca32422d35d98c.jpg"},{"icon":"d9b11c1fd84bcdf63d32d3e3046203f562a6851b.jpg","localized_name":"Remote Control","name":"Remote Control","path